# No `waku` imports in apps

SSOT: [`docs/standards/working-agreement.md`](../../docs/standards/working-agreement.md) (`no-waku-app-imports`).
ESLint enforces.

- Apps: `last-ts/config`, `last-ts/server`, `last-ts/Waku`, `last-ts/vite` — never `waku` / `waku/*`.
- `waku` is an optional peer of `last-ts` only (`packages/last-ts/**` may import it).
- No `getConfig` / `pageConfig` / `Page.asDefault`.
- Teaching spine: [`docs/handoffs/last-ts-spine.md`](../../docs/handoffs/last-ts-spine.md).
